    "snippet": "---\ntitle: List of Days of Our Lives characters introduced in the 2020s - Wikipedia\ndate: 2021-07-31\n---\nname: Jake DiMera\nseries: Days of Our Lives\nportrayer: Brandon Barash\nyears: 2020\u20132023\nfirst: 23 04 2020\nlast: 20 02 2023\ncreator: Ron Carlivati\nintroducer: Ken Corday, Albert Alarr and Greg Meng\nclassification: Former, regular\nalias: * Jacob Lambert, * Jake DiMera\noccupation: Mechanic\nfamily: DiMera\nparents: * Stefano DiMera, * Vivian Alamain\nbrothers: Stefan DiMera\nhalfbrothers: * Andr\u00e9 DiMera, * Tony DiMera (legal), * Peter Blake (adoptive), * Quinn Hudson, * Benjy Hawk, * EJ DiMera, * Chad DiMera\nhalfsisters: * Ren\u00e9e DuMonde, * Megan Hathaway, * Kristen DiMera (adoptive), * Lexie Carver\ngrandparents: Santo DiMera\nuncles: Leopold AlamainRyan Brady\nnieces/nephews: * Dimitri Von Leuschner, * Theo Carver, * Steven Hawk, * Johnny DiMera, * Sydney DiMera, * Grace Brady, * Thomas DiMera, * Charlotte DiMera, * Rachel Black (adoptive), * Daniel DiMera\ncousins: * John Black (adoptive), * Lawrence Alamain\n\nname: Gwen Rizczech\nseries: Days of Our Lives\nportrayer: Emily O'Brien (2020\u2013present)Linsey Godfrey (2022)\nyears: 2020\u20132023\nfirst: 05 06 2020\nlast: November 17, 2023\ncreator: Ron Carlivati\nintroducer: Ken Corday, Albert Alarr and Greg Meng\nclassification: Former, regular\nalias: * Gwendolyn Rizczech, * Sarah Horton (2022)\noccupation: Journalist Nanny\nparents: * Jack Deveraux, * Tiffany Rizczech\nstepparents: Jennifer Horton\nhusband: Dimitri Von Leuschner (m. 2023)\nsiblings: * Abigail Deveraux, * JJ Deveraux\ngrandparents: * Duke"
