nHere's everything to know about Kris Kristofferson's eight children: Tracy, Kris Jr., Casey, Jesse, Jody, Johnny, Kelly Marie and Blake.\n\nTracy Kristofferson, 63\n\nTracy was born on Jan. 9, 1962. She is the oldest of the Kristofferson children and Kris' first child from his"
